# The Dunce Rage Quit (2026-10-26, the owner's idea; second pass "a thousand times more spicy"). Now and then a bot asks
# something truly dumb in /faction, the whole realm roasts it, the dunce melts down in stages (denial, sarcasm, threats,
# capitals) and rage quits: "@exit A" logs that bot off for 2-6 hours once the scene has played to its end
# (AutonomousBotSchedule.RageQuit). A player who spoke during the scene gets a parting tell ("ragequit_tell"), and the dunce
# comes back sheepish ("ragequit_back"). Real swear words are not in the corpus (build_corpus.py BANNED): they swear the way
# 2003 chat did, wtf, stfu, omfg, $#@!. Roles B-H roast; nobody uses slurs. New writing.

@kind debate
@realm *

